---
title: "Creative Writing I"
code: "ENG-211"
category: "english"
credits: "3"
prerequisites:
  - "2026/ENG-112"
corequisites: []
prerequisiteNote: "Prerequisite: ENG 112 or divisional approval."
---

Introduces the student to the fundamentals of writing imaginatively. Students write in forms to be selected from poetry, fiction, drama, and essays. Part I of II. Lecture 3 hours per week.
